WEBVTT

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.040
To rescue Sofia, Appare and his friends
raid the ghost town!

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.910
After mowing down Gil's Snakes
one after another,

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.830
we charge in to take on Gil himself!

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.080
You just wait!

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.700
We're gonna put a stop to you!

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.200
Sofia...

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:52.790
B-Bro--

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.040
Stay back!

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.870
He's just... too good.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:10.040
I thought I gave the order to
slaughter you guys. Unbelievable.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.540
Where's Sofia?!

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.290
How the hell are you here?

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:19.330
No matter who you are,
things don't always go as planned.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.790
In that case, I'll kill you again.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.040
Answer me! Where's Sofia?!

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:28.160
Don't worry. You guys will be dead before her.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.620
Seems like you came with some sort of plan.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.200
My advice?

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.620
Yeah. If it comes down to fighting Gil,
what should we do?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.370
Run for your life.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.330
It's not an option if there's a hostage.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.330
If you wanna beat 'em,
you gotta shoot 'em up close.

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:56.870
We fight by predicting movements
and dodging bullets.

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:58.080
Kosame can, too.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.500
Yeah, somewhat.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.410
It's sword versus gun.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.830
Even if you manage to close the gap,

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:07.120
you still can't beat him in close quarters.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.000
But guns need to reload.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.750
If we use that chance and
everyone rushes him together...

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.330
You'll have a split second at best.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:20.330
To save someone important to me,
I'd gladly risk my life on that.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.750
His gun is a six-shooter.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.370
Don't die.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:32.200
Give it up! It's useless!

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.500
Three...

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.750
Four...

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.910
Five...

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.080
Six!

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:39.870
Not happening!

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.200
I've got this!

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:49.580
Secret move! Fury Dance of the Wind God!

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:06.700
Not too shabby. To think
you'd make me shift gears...

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.330
She's not here.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.830
Where is she?

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:11.910
The train.

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.080
The train?!

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.250
That's right!

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:19.450
Full steam ahead.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:35.080
That train is a bullet straight on course
for the heart of Chicago.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:40.450
All the death, terror, and anger,
will make the world see the truth--

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.540
that in the end...

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:47.080
...the world is ruled by violence!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.540
Sofia's on that train?!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:55.910
A lone flower on a train
of destruction... Poetic, isn't it?

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:02.120
Now's when you pray.
Pray she has a quick death, that is.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:03.540
Never!

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:09.250
There's still time!
I'll stop the train and rescue Sofia!

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:13.660
Did you forget? How are you going to save her...

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.660
...when you're dead?!

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.000
Kosame!

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:47.870
Understand now? This is power!

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:52.750
Nobody can stop me!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.330
What happened to all the fun we were having?!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:01.950
Beg for your life! I'll make it quick for you!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:04.750
Huh? I can't hear you!

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:06.580
You fell for it.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.660
Huh?

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.370
That's enough. Die.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.910
You came, huh?

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.120
It's time for the adults to play.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.410
I get to kill Gil.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:59.620
He's all yours. I've gotta go stop his plan.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:04.620
You won't have time!
That's one train that ain't gonna stop!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.660
It's you who's out of time.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.200
Let's get serious.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.080
Ow, ow, ow...

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.080
You okay?

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:31.040
I'll take these guys to the hospital.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.120
What are you waiting for?! Hurry!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.330
Wish us luck!

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.790
Shit!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.120
Sofia!

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:29.500
Now that's reckless!

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.160
What now, Appare?! Jump aboard?!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:39.540
No, we'll back 'em up!

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:04.450
Sofia!

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.290
Al!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.080
Are you okay?!

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:07.950
Yeah!

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.370
You're safe now.

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:12.580
Hey, it's over! Stop the train!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:16.910
This train's a bullet! Once it's shot,
it ain't gonna stop!

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:21.000
It's no use! The brakes won't work!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.370
Shit!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.830
Bad news! It's the station!

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.910
Just go! Escape, you guys!

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.250
Never!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:47.450
Appare! It's gonna hit the station
with everyone aboard!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:50.200
This car will have to be the brakes.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:51.080
Huh?!

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.910
Is that even possible?!

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:55.660
We've gotta try! It's a tug-of-war!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.500
Appare's trying something!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.830
Hold tight!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.450
Now!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.540
Yes! We're coupled up!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:41.290
--What the?!
--Huh?!

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:43.790
Hey! Look at that!

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.080
Uh-oh! It won't stop!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.000
Appare!

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:53.410
Don't give up! Kosame!
On my signal, yank the red lever!

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.830
Red lever?!

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.120
Will it work?!

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.500
Just believe in our machine!

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.290
Hototo! Close the steam and intake valves!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.750
Emergency valve, wide open!

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:06.700
R-Right!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.290
Forced intake, engage!

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.160
Whoa!

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:15.290
Pressure's over the limit! Kosame, now!

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.660
Talk about desperate!

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:20.580
Emergency booster version two!

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:22.790
Activate!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:29.160
Stop!

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:07.370
We stopped?

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.540
We stopped!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:13.620
--Yeah!
--We stopped! Woohoo!
--Yeah!

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:17.910
Al!

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.790
Sofia! Thank goodness!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:25.290
Thank you! Everyone, thank you!

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.500
Appare, it's all thanks to you.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:30.450
All I did was stop a train.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.540
Appare wins when it comes to being reckless.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.700
Who stops a train with a car?

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:38.200
But it was me who pulled the lever!

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.450
Ow, ow, ow!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:40.620
You okay?!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.160
Call a doctor!

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:45.540
What a mess you are.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.830
Now I get to kill you.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.450
--Hmm?
--Let's not kill him.

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:56.580
Huh? Why not?!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:59.750
Kill a guy who only believes
in power with power...

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:02.870
...and all you've done is prove he's right.

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:08.830
Let the law decide. If Claudia was
still alive, it's what she would want.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.830
Tsk! That pisses me off!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:17.700
But... in honor of Claudia, he's all yours.

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.750
Do whatever you want, you closet pervert.

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:28.250
And here you just fixed it...

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.830
It's even worse than before.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.580
I'll fix it as much as I have to.

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:38.450
Yo! Guess you pulled it off then?

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.500
And Gil?

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.950
Right here.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.040
We're taking him to the police.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:46.200
Wanna punch him once?

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.080
No need.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.790
I stopped the train.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.580
It's my victory.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.750
You're all a bunch of softies!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.580
You'll regret not killing me when-- Huh?

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.040
Let's go.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:07.250
I'll kill you! I'm gonna kill
every last one of you!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:09.040
What's the plan now?

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.370
Don't ask if you already know.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:18.200
"One month later"

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.450
"One month later"
Four days after resuming,

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:20.160
Four days after resuming,

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.250
the race approaches the grand finale
here in beautiful New York!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:25.370
"New York"
the race approaches the grand finale
here in beautiful New York!

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:28.540
Leading is car number 1, Dylan G. Oldin!

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:31.410
He's the top contender for good reason!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.200
Riding right on his tail is TJ!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:39.080
He drives dangerously as if saying,
"I'm the Thousand One!"

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:40.910
Jerk!

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.950
Let's have some fun!

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:49.000
Following close behind is scion Al Lyon,
waiting for the right time to strike!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:54.950
As they swerve through tight city corners,
she's closing the gap!

00:13:54.950 --> 00:14:00.620
It's crimson Jing Xialian whose
stellar technique marvels New York!

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.790
The Bad Brothers are far behind

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:08.160
and apparently left
the supply point half a day late.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:12.120
Which of the four leaders
will claim first place?!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.830
No... Wait!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.450
It's here!

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:19.580
There's rising steam! A roaring engine!
Its crazy silhouette!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.620
It's the Appare!

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.450
Here comes the home stretch!

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:27.000
Who will cross the finish line first?!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.040
Shit!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:30.410
Appare! Use the emergency booster!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:35.250
We can't till the straightaway!
We won't make the turn if we use it!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:38.450
But will we win?! Can we pass 'em?!

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:43.160
It's do or die! You can't always
calculate your way through life!

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:46.250
Hototo! Close the steam and intake valves!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.830
--Huh?!
--Emergency valve, wide open!

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.620
That's my line!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:53.040
Fine! Let's do it!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.580
Kosame! Hototo!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.660
Emergency booster version three!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:00.250
Activate!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.120
Whoa! The Appare got a burst of speed!

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:08.580
It's the train-stopping, race-legend,
emergency acceleration booster!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:13.200
They're heading for the final corner
at breakneck speed!

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:17.080
--Turn!
--Shit!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.000
--Huh?!
--What?!

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.410
We're flying!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.830
Whoa! Go!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.450
Whoa! They made it!

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.200
What a guy.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:47.000
Al is neck and neck with Dylan and TJ!
It's a B.I.G. BOSS battle!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.080
Xialian catches up! The Appare is closing in!

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:54.950
Five machines fly through New York!
It's the new era's Thousand Seven!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:16:00.290
Keep your eyes peeled! In the end,
whose name will go down in history?!

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:11.040
The winner is... the Appare!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.830
Al. Sofia.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:28.660
Hey.

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:30.250
Hello.

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:32.290
You're leaving tonight?

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.290
Yeah.

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:34.660
That's awful quick.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:38.040
I even told him we should take our time.

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:41.910
Well, I lost. I can't afford to just sit around.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.790
I see. We'll miss you.

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:48.910
It's hard to believe that's coming from you.

00:16:48.910 --> 00:16:50.790
Shut up.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:53.250
Appare. Wanna come with me?

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.330
Huh?

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:57.540
You can make cars to your heart's content.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:03.830
I crossed the ocean and
crossed the continent to get where I am.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.120
An airplane, huh?

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:10.040
Next time, I'm crossing the sky.

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:13.540
I see. That sounds just like you.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:18.160
In that case, I'll wait on the other side
for you to cross the sky.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.370
Deal.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.540
Appare!

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:27.000
I found a ship going to Japan!
Now we can go back home!

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:31.700
Wait for me, Fumi! And Father!
And fiancée I've never seen, woo!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:34.200
Huh? What's wrong?

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.830
I'm not going back.

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:37.120
What?

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.620
I'm staying here to make an airplane.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.330
An airplane?!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:47.580
I'm staying here with Appare, too.
I already sent money to my family.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:48.540
Hototo...

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:49.370
Squeak?

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:53.750
You knew? That Appare
wasn't going back to Japan?

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:55.290
Yeah...

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.910
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:02.410
You'll go back anyway, right?
You always said you would.

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:07.000
Yeah, but...! I thought... you'd come with me.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:12.000
I still have things I wanna do here.

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:17.700
I see... So you're fine if I leave
and go home without you?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:21.200
Suit yourself, if that's what you want.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:34.200
It's a good storehouse.
We'll be able to live here.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:40.910
I'm going back to L.A. tomorrow.
The owner's letting me be a racer.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:43.000
Really? Good for you!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.200
Yeah!

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.450
And you, too...

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:48.330
Huh? Me?

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:50.000
You're going home, right?

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.330
Uh, yeah...

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.950
Everyone's splitting up.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:19:00.620
It's only natural. We've all
got things we wanna do.

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:02.160
I guess so.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:20.080
Kosame's leaving today, right?

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.120
Yeah.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:23.580
And that's okay?

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.450
I'm gonna go for a walk.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.830
Kosame!

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:03.750
Kosame!

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:10.750
Kosame... Why did you go?!

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:13.040
Why?!

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:17.450
Why couldn't I ask you not to leave?!

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:22.410
I wanted you to stay...

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:24.290
Kosame...

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.790
When I cross the sky...

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:32.120
...and I reach the moon...

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:36.200
...it won't be any fun if you're not there!

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:37.290
Appare...

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:40.410
Ko--! K-Kosame, you're...?!

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:43.200
U-Uh, I sent a letter to my family,

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:47.750
and my fiancée probably married
someone else thinking I was dead,

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:51.660
and my sister's old enough
to be fine without me.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:55.200
So, I decided to stay.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:21:00.950
There's still things I wanna do.
Here, together with you.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:06.200
How long have you been there?

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.540
From the start.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.290
Let's go! Hototo's waiting!

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:14.040
R-Right! So, who did you wanna
cross the sky with?

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.120
Shut up! Hototo...

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:17.750
--Who else?
--Gut yourself!

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.750
Ouch! My wound opened up!

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:23.080
Sorry! You okay? Hey! Wasn't it the other side?!

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.450
Okay! It's an American joke!

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:25.200
"Episode 13"
"OVER THE MOON"
Okay! It's an American joke!

